Widgetarium is published under two licences. Each folder below carries the
full text of its own.

MIT — use it for anything, including a commercial product:

  packages/kit/   the component kit every widget and screen is drawn with
                  packages/kit/LICENSE
  registry/       the widget library
                  registry/LICENSE

FSL-1.1-ALv2 (Functional Source License 1.1, Apache 2.0 Future License) —
use, change and share it for any purpose except offering it, or something
substantially similar built from it, as a competing commercial product or
service. Each version becomes Apache 2.0 two years after its release:

  packages/core/  the engine that lays out and renders boards
                  packages/core/LICENSE
  packages/sdk/   the types a widget is written against
                  packages/sdk/LICENSE
  apps/obsidian/  the Obsidian plugin
                  apps/obsidian/LICENSE

Anything outside these folders (tools, docs) is under FSL-1.1-ALv2 as in
packages/core/LICENSE. REUSE.toml maps every path to its licence.

For a commercial licence to build a competing product, contact the author.

